   "source": [
    "# Quiz: Introduction to time series forecasting\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-7-1-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Time Series Forecasting is useful in</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>determining future costs</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. That is one use, but not the only one. Forecasting can also predict a future price from past prices.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>predicting future pricing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Pricing is one use, but not the only one. Forecasting predicts a variable's future value from its past, so it works for costs too.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>both the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Forecasting uses a variable's past to predict its future value. That helps with pricing, inventory and supply chain problems.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-7-1-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>A time series is a sequence taken at:</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>successive equally spaced points in space</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. A time series is ordered by time, not by place in space.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>successive equally spaced points in time</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. A time series is a sequence of data points taken at equally spaced points in time.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>successive equally spaced points in space and time</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Only time matters here. The points are equally spaced in time, not in space.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-7-1-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Time series can be used in:</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>earthquake prediction</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Earthquake prediction is one of the fields where data points can be plotted over time.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>computer vision</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Time series are used in fields where events occur and data points can be plotted over time, like earthquake prediction.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>color analysis</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Time series are used in fields where events occur and data points can be plotted over time, like earthquake prediction.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
