    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-7-1-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Time series trends are</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Measurable increases and decreases over time</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Trends are measurable increases and decreases over time.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Quantifying decreases over time</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Trends include increases as well as decreases, not only decreases.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Gaps between increases and decreases over time</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Trends are the increases and decreases themselves, not the gaps between them.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-7-1-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Outliers are</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>points close to standard data variance</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Outliers are far away from the standard data variance, not close to it.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>points far away from standard data variance</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Outliers are far away from the standard data variance.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>points within standard data variance</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Outliers are far away from the standard data variance, not inside it.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
